### Sample requests for the DANS API (VS Code REST Client or Visual Studio).
### Sign-in uses an HttpOnly cookie: run "Sign in" first — the tool keeps the cookie for the following requests.
### Requests that change data must include the header X-Requested-With: XMLHttpRequest (CSRF protection).
@baseUrl = https://localhost:7180

### Sign in
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
X-Requested-With: XMLHttpRequest

{
  "email": "official@dans.local",
  "password": "Demo@123"
}

### Who is signed in
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/session

### Active alerts (public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/alerts?status=active

### Evacuation centers (public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/evacuation-centers

### Dashboard summary (staff)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/dashboard

### Active incident reports (staff)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reports?activeOnly=true

### Issue an alert to two barangays (officials and admins)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/alerts
Content-Type: application/json
X-Requested-With: XMLHttpRequest

{
  "title": "Flash Flood Warning",
  "message": "Water levels in the river are rising quickly. Residents near the riverbank should evacuate now.",
  "instructions": "Go to the nearest open evacuation center.\nDo not cross flooded roads.",
  "type": "Flood",
  "severity": "Critical",
  "barangayIds": [12, 14]
}

### Sign out (ends the session on the server)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/logout
X-Requested-With: XMLHttpRequest
